  "title": "Adding MEMTRACE_TOKEN Environment Variable",
  "content": {
    "type": "factual",
    "format": "markdown",
    "body": "To support `list_workspaces` and future write tool access to `/api/v1/workspaces`, the `MEMTRACE_TOKEN` environment variable was added. This variable injects the API token into the `Authorization: Bearer` header of `apiFetch`."
  },
